WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:08.940
Milly, I'm going to show your shame to the whole world!

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.150
Stop!

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.330
Hey, hey! Perk up!

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:22.790
I'm gonna put this on YouTube!

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:27.380
Lately.... lots of people have been illegally

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:30.760
downloading TV programs over the internet.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:34.300
Look at all the comments!

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:39.390
There are a lot of people enjoying your embarrassment right now.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:47.150
If you don't have the rights
holder's permission, distribution...

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:52.070
Bootlegging is prohibited by law!

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.450
Do you understand that, you perverted magical girl?

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:56.740
...Yes...

00:00:56.740 --> 00:01:00.330
Our big friends should remember that too.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:01.910
Be careful.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.080
Fight!

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:06.120
In one strike!

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:09.130
Charge!

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.260
Good, good...

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.930
It's best if we call it a day, Plug.

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:22.970
Can't we do a couple more?

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.310
I'm really pumped right now!

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:27.900
Wouldn't want to lose my touch.

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:32.230
What nonsense. Working overtime just because you feel like it...

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:35.030
Because of you, the higher-ups are getting suspicious of me too.

00:01:35.030 --> 00:01:36.650
Wait a sec...

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:40.030
I see someone who needs charging this instant!

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:43.580
That hurts!

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:46.460
Listen up, you idiot!

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.210
Keep up with this nonsense and you'll regret it one day!

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:54.670
Is this what you meant?

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:58.550
Not sure, but I've got a bad feeling about it...

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.010
Reika Galvani.

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:05.480
And Kuran Shunt.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:11.360
They're Neodym, Inc. - Audit Division, Special Cases Section.

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:13.650
Also known as the Leakage Ladies.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:20.470
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:20.470
Miracles are right beside reality

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:23.560
Kanarazu aru

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:23.560
They're there for sure

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:34.910
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:34.910
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:40.820
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:40.820
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:46.760
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:46.760
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:52.940
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:52.940
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:54.350
Hitori janai

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:54.350
You're not alone

00:02:55.030 --> 00:03:00.620
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:02:55.030 --> 00:03:00.620
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:06.560
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:06.560
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:12.500
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:12.500
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:18.480
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:18.480
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:24.350
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:24.350
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:32.140
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:32.140
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.410
Plug Cryostat.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:55.130
When you charged up the class Z subject and suffered the backfeed,

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:58.960
you caused an extraordinary
amount of energy to be wasted.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.340
Wasted?

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:04.720
Despite the enormous amount of energy,

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:10.310
there were no traces of electromagnetic disturbance afterwards.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.520
Don't you think that's a bit odd?

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:16.650
What are you saying?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:23.860
The two of you are being investigated for deliberately causing that incident, gathering wasted energy and sell-

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:29.080
No, smuggling it to illegitimate third-parties.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:33.000
We're smugglers?

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.120
That's not true!

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:37.750
I got both of my arms horribly burned in that incident!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.380
I would never do such a thing!

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.420
That's right!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:43.380
And where's the evidence to support your...

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:45.390
Calm down, both of you.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:50.640
In addition, there's one other thing I'd like to bring to your attention.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:54.020
It involves a specific person, who, recently...

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.810
...have been in constant contact with you.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.440
Sentou Oumi.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.150
A premonition?

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.950
Audit Division, Special Cases Section - Leakage Ladies!

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.910
Audit Division, Special Cases Section - Leakage Ladies!

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:15.790
We're accompanying you to conduct our own investigation.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:19.130
Please proceed with your work as naturally as possible.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.380
"Naturally," they say?

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:24.630
They just want to see if we'll go and check on Sentou.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:28.390
Why are they concerned about Sentou?

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.220
Don't tell me, a live body experimentation?!

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.600
Like this?

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:34.560
Or this?!

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:35.600
So exhilarating!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.020
As if that will happen!

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:40.230
There isn't really a need for you to know.

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:42.650
What's with the attitude?

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.900
<i>I admit there's a distinction between us,</i>

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.570
<i>but do they really have to be so condescending?</i>

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:52.080
Hey, how about we ditch these
snobs? That'll make our day.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.790
For once, I agree with you.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:00.250
Insulate!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.800
Hold it!

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:10.850
Where you do you think you're going in such a hurry?

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:12.930
Didn't we just say "as naturally as possible"?

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.930
Sorry, but this how we do things!

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:18.390
Don't bother catching up with us now!

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:20.440
We don't plan on doing anything wrong!

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.660
Must it come to this, Silica?

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:32.530
Right you are, Milly.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:33.870
You can win!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:40.960
Against that narrow-minded bitch's washboard chest, Milly's A cups will surely prevail in this battle!

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.290
I won't lose!

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.670
Stealth mode to maximum!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.140
<i>She's gaining on me.</i>

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.220
<i>As expected of them.</i>

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.270
However...

00:06:57.270 --> 00:07:00.310
...our experience on the job gives us an advantage!

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:06.230
For example, using our stealth like this.

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:07.440
Stealth disengaged!

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:12.780
How?

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:13.870
Disengage!

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.580
Very clever.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.790
If I use this, do you think you'll still win?

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.550
Miracle Silicone!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.760
T-That's...

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.890
Even if it's fake, it's still an H-cup!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:37.850
Do you yield?

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:42.100
Mistress Silica, isn't that going a bit overboard?

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.060
I... lost.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.190
Milly!

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:46.980
I did it!

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:49.940
"Leakage Ladies" my ass!

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.070
Don't look down on us Charging Ladies!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.120
At this rate, there isn't a need to trouble Sentou.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.540
He'll definitely be proud of me...

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.290
You sure are naïve.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.710
Did you really think you'd get
away from us with cheap tricks?

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:09.340
Unbelievable!

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:11.050
Believe it.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.300
Catching you Charging Ladies is child's play.

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:22.850
I'm not sure how effective
their communication tracker is,

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:25.100
so I'd best fly low and stay away from them.

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.030
Alesta!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.700
Se-Sentou!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:36.820
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:38.660
<i>My mind was wandering...</i>

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:41.830
<i>...and I subconsciously flew to see Sentou!</i>

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.710
What's up? Here to charge someone up?

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:46.790
If that's so, where's Plug?

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:51.210
You can't, Sentou! Please act as though you can't see us, as if we're not here.

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:53.470
What are you saying?

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:54.680
And where's the fire?

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.390
So, this is Sentou Oumi.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.640
You really can see us.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.350
This definitely is of great interest.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:06.690
Are you also a Charging Lady?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.110
If you're here to help...

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.740
Stand aside.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:17.780
Sentou?

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.490
What do you intend to do with that?

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.750
Oh, you should know.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:27.130
I don't take kindly to people
treating other people as objects.

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:28.540
Well, that's...

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:29.960
And one more thing.

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:32.340
You frighten Alesta.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:35.220
As her elder, there's no need to bully, right?

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:37.760
Elder?

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.390
How old do you think I am?

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:45.100
Neodym, Inc. - Audit Division, Special Cases Section, a.k.a. the Leakage Ladies.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:46.600
Name: Reika Galvani

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:47.520
Age:

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.480
Shut up.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:53.690
Whatever, an enemy of Alesta is my enemy as well!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:56.650
<i>Sentou...</i>

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:58.820
Hey, Sentou!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:09:59.910
What are you doing?

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:06.330
This is not the right place for this, Sentou.

00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.790
This is what it looks like to everyone else.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.000
What's with the bat, out of the blue?

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.010
That's a bit reckless, don't you think?

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:16.630
He's looking over here.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:17.760
Shame on him.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:19.970
This doesn't look good?

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.720
Newspaper: Perverted Bat Whacker!

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:26.890
Over here!

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.520
Let's withdraw for now.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.150
To where?

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.480
Just come along!

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:33.820
Sentou!

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:34.440
Hold it, you!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.650
Wait!

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.740
What the...?

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:47.500
Sentou Oumi?

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:05.930
Hey, Alesta! Alesta...

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:16.150
Sentou...

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.370
What a view!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.710
You guys get to see this all time?

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:37.090
Not really, we only came here for a change of scenery.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.920
There's no one in need of charging here.

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:42.550
Also, oxygen levels here are also frighteningly low.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:46.760
Is that so? Maybe that's why I feel woozy...

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:49.980
Sentou!

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:53.100
Sorry about that.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:55.230
I'm usually more focused.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:59.070
But at least no-one will see you up here.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:02.450
Yeah, that was one hell of a ride, I'd say.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:09.330
I'm happy for that.

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.620
"...an enemy of Alesta is my enemy as well."

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:17.500
Surely... that must be a confession of love, right?

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.300
But why are those bimbos after you?

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:24.800
Man, more weird chicks popping up.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.220
What was that all about, Alesta?

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.930
Well, you see...

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:33.060
<i>Not good.</i>

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:37.070
<i>If he finds out we'd been messing with them just to get away...</i>

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.360
Do you read me, Alesta Blanket?

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.370
I presume Sentou Oumi is with you?

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.620
Let's be civilized and discuss this.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:51.080
You can be civil, can you not?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.160
We're very busy people.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:55.750
There's nothing worth discussing.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:56.750
Because of you...

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:00.920
Plug Cryostat is now in our custody.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:03.010
What the...!

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:05.470
Custody?

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:09.970
This... I'm no criminal, and I won't be a hostage either!

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.520
I tire of these petty games.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:16.600
Of course, I'll always catch you if you try to escape.

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:22.190
Such a stubborn accomplice.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.990
Say something to him, too.

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.360
Me?

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:29.200
Well... let's see...

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.830
Don't worry about me, Sentou!

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.040
Just run!

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:36.040
Plug!

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:37.790
Now, was that necessary?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:41.920
The damsel in distress always warns the rescuing hero!

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:44.720
This is just like that episode of Milly...

00:13:45.430 --> 00:13:47.510
Plug, answer me!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.720
What have you done to Plug?!

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:53.600
Save me, Sir Sentou!

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:56.230
We're not doing anything to her!

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.230
Please, it hurts!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:14:00.400
We await a meaningful discussion with you both.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.190
Proceed to these coordinates.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:04.740
We'll be expecting you.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.160
Plug...

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:12.290
Wouldn't it be best if we continued to distance ourselves from them?

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.040
I guess not...

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.850
Now this goes way beyond criminal!

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:35.730
She's close to us.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.190
Is she making us come to her?

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:45.240
According to the readings, she's not carrying any weapons.

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:48.110
Then again, that's not really a charging lady's style.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:51.620
Wow! It shows you all that?

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:54.160
Your gizmo's functions are way better.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:55.830
Naturally.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:59.290
After all, we're the Audit Division, Special Cases Section's Leakage Ladies.

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.420
We're not like you charging ladies.

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.920
Especially misfits like you.

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.510
What was that, you?!

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:07.880
That so pisses me off!

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.590
Well then, I'll take the bait.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:14.720
What a bother.

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:18.230
You charging ladies should just stick to charging.

00:15:18.230 --> 00:15:22.440
Why don't you try doing it for once?!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:26.280
You obviously have far better toys and skills than us.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.650
Yet you waste your sweet time...

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:31.410
...making bogus accusations and playing BDSM!

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:34.780
Maybe if you turn over a new leaf and become a charging lady,

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:37.290
you'd save a whole lot more people!

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:38.750
Not possible.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:45.000
We can never become charging ladies.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:49.050
That's why we need you to do your best.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.140
<i>What do you mean?</i>

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.930
Stop this, Alesta!

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:01.900
Still want to play cops and robbers, huh?

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:07.320
Disengage!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:08.480
Stealth mode to maximum!

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.580
<i>I can't seem to lose her...</i>

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:20.660
Still sticking to your old tricks, are you?

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:23.000
You charging ladies don't seem
to be able to read a situation.

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.460
<i>Keep thinking that, imbecile.</i>

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:32.130
We win.

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.890
Kuran, come in.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:42.480
Kuran!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.060
It's got to be Sentou's doing...

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:48.360
For a parallel, he sure is troublesome.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.900
You go, Sentou!

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:54.360
Even the leakage ladies are no match against you.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:01.410
Yeah, you're really something...

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:04.750
Not like a pitiful girl like me...

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.340
But I can't be depressed right now!

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:11.010
He's doing the best he can and I have to pitch in, too!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:20.220
We charging ladies mean business!

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:32.940
Missed her!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:39.580
Now you've really done it.

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:42.120
I'd like to ask, where'd you get that bat?

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:45.160
Worrying about such details will only add wrinkles to your face, you hag.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:51.460
Neodym, Inc. - Audit Division, Special Cases Section, a.k.a. the Leakage Ladies.

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:52.760
Name: Reika Galvani

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:53.760
Her laugh lines are...

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.380
Shut it, will you?

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.890
Why did this have to happen?

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:00.760
We just wanted to calmly discuss things.

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:02.720
Where's Plug?

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.100
Sentou?

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.140
Give her back now...

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:08.520
and I'll decide your punishment after.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.230
Why are you so involved with these charging ladies?

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:12.860
Maybe Alesta...

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:17.410
But the failure that is Plug isn't worth the trouble you put yourself through.

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:20.530
I don't care whether she's a failure or not.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:24.040
Are you saying you completely trust her?

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:28.580
Or is it because of what she did for your family and friends?

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:29.790
Yeah.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.460
I'm thankful for that.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.050
Who wouldn't be?

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:37.550
But that's what we do.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.720
Whoever it is, it's our job.

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:44.560
Have you ever seen the people she charged up?

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:45.640
I haven't.

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:49.100
I've seen the good that charging ladies do.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:55.150
She burned her arms for a reward no salary could match.

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:58.570
Before, I just thought of her as a complete klutz.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.410
But she has helped save many people...

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:03.660
...and that's incredible.

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:10.880
Yes, she saved me and she's
going to save many others still.

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:15.090
That's why I intend to stay by her side.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:19.510
Because of her, we can still live our lives in this world.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:21.840
Sentou...

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:27.850
You don't know the first thing about her, so don't you dare call her a failure!

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.730
Is that it?

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:33.570
Unfortunately, I need you to compose yourself.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:37.690
A collector ring?

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:40.410
You plan to use that on a person?!

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:46.160
It's a containment device capable of discharging 500,000 volts.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.160
Think of it as a strong stun gun.

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:53.500
Plug lost both of her arms because of a shock like this.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:57.010
If your faith in her is that strong,
then you should be able to stand this.

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:59.630
You bitch!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:03.180
Plug?!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.180
It's my turn to help!

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.270
Stop it, what are you...

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:09.140
Don't just stand there looking silly, Alesta!

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.390
Got it!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.610
S-Stop this instant, you two!

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:17.820
Ever heard of the tale of the three arrows?

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.650
Like I care.

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:22.410
Wrong answer. You should go back to school!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:28.330
We won!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:33.920
'Scuse me.

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:35.130
What was that for?!

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:35.840
What do mean?

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.840
I just saved him!

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:39.960
But you got caught!

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:41.380
Shut up, Forehead!

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:43.050
Forehead?!

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:45.140
What?!

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:48.810
You did all of this just because
you wanted to piss them off?!

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:51.310
This is all your fault!

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:52.560
But...

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.310
I-I'm so sorry.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.770
I'm sorry, so sorry, sorry!

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:58.570
This was all a huge misunderstanding.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.030
So please forgive me!

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:03.030
Well, as long as we're clear on what has transpired.

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.700
And now...

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:07.120
We get to do our investigation on you.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.790
They're going through with the experiments.

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:15.670
No way!

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:18.250
Lick this, please.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:20.460
That goes for you two.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:26.180
Figures, they're clean.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:31.390
Yes, none of them match the electromagnetic signatures found at the scene.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:35.140
The three of you are cleared of our scrutiny.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.600
We're done here.

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:38.190
Thanks for your cooperation!

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:40.110
You're done?

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:42.490
We went through all this trouble...

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:43.780
...just to lick that thing?

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:44.570
Correct.

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:45.660
You were expecting something else?

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:49.160
Is that seriously it...

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:52.200
Man, look what you made us do...

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:54.580
But I'm glad it's all over!

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:55.750
We can now live happily with our-

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:57.080
Oh no you don't!

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:00.800
I really spilled my guts for you!

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:05.130
Green caption: Aroused

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:02.760
I was worried sick!

00:22:02.760 --> 00:22:05.130
Well, back to the drawing board it seems.

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:08.680
But it was quite surprising that they took us down with such ease.

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:12.350
Sentou Oumi... You've piqued our interest.

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:14.140
You're in this too, Alesta!

00:22:14.140 --> 00:22:15.730
Yes! Hit me!

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:28.740
She tripped down the stairs?

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:29.780
Seriously?

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:31.910
That's totally hilarious!

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:36.040
No... I really want to try dying for once...

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:38.630
What's that? That's not even funny!

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:51.850
Honto wa totemo TOUGH nan da yo

00:22:48.380 --> 00:22:51.850
Really, I'm quite tough, you know

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:54.680
Hitori demo heiki de

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:54.680
I'm fine even all by myself

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:57.440
Doko ni demo ikeru no

00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:57.440
I can go anywhere at all

00:22:57.440 --> 00:23:00.190
Koibito nante iranai

00:22:57.440 --> 00:23:00.190
I don't need a boyfriend or anything

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:05.690
Takumashiku ikiteikunda to kimetetanda

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:05.690
I decided that I would live strong

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:07.450
Kimi to deau made wa

00:23:05.690 --> 00:23:07.450
Until the day I could meet you

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:15.450
Sore wa arigachi na

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:15.450
"That really is

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.250
Warui kuse da yo

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.250
It's a bad habit

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:21.040
Hanashi janai ka? nante

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:21.040
such an often-heard saying, right?"

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:23.840
Toshiue buranaide ne

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:23.840
Don't pretend to be older than you are

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:28.970
Datte ne watashi wa itsumo tokubetsu

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:28.970
But you know, I'm always an exceptional case

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:32.140
Kimi ni mo kitto SPECIAL deshou

00:23:29.340 --> 00:23:32.140
I'm sure I'm special to you, too

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:33.850
Sore de nakya iya

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:33.850
I couldn't stand it any other way

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:37.640
Zettai watashi soba ni iru yo

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:37.640
I'll definitely always be beside you

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:45.690
Kimi ga ochikondara namida fusegu kasa ni naritainda yo

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:41.770
I want to become the umbrella

00:23:41.770 --> 00:23:45.690
that shields you from tears when you're feeling down

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:51.280
Keredo mamoreteru no wa naze ka watashi bakari

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:48.610
But why is it that I'm the one

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:51.280
who always ends up being protected?

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:57.540
Kimochi no naka no koishi ne tsumazuite korobisou na toki

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:57.540
At the times when, in my heart, I stumble and seem about to fall

00:23:57.750 --> 00:24:02.290
Itsumo sotto sasaete kureru

00:23:57.750 --> 00:24:02.290
Keep supporting me just a little, always

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:06.800
Futoshita kizuna itoshii yo

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:06.800
I'll treasure this unexpected bond

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:08.130
Itsumademo

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:08.130
Now and forever

00:24:08.510 --> 00:24:12.340
Eien Sweetheart

00:24:08.510 --> 00:24:12.340
Eternally, Sweetheart

00:24:17.140 --> 00:24:21.310
I never realized you felt that way about me, Sentou!

00:24:21.310 --> 00:24:23.560
"...an enemy of Alesta is my enemy as well."

00:24:23.560 --> 00:24:26.730
Sentou, my love! Just recalling that makes me giddy...

00:24:26.730 --> 00:24:30.200
Hello, guys? Sorry to interrupt your fantasies but the preview's up.

00:24:31.280 --> 00:24:33.990
Make it good, you dregs!

00:24:33.990 --> 00:24:36.030
On the next episode of
Fight In one Strike! Charging Ladies!!:

00:24:35.780 --> 00:24:45.710
Present!?

00:24:36.030 --> 00:24:37.240
Present!?

00:24:37.240 --> 00:24:39.160
Is Christmas around the corner?!

00:24:39.160 --> 00:24:42.040
It's a momentous occasion for those young lovers!

00:24:43.080 --> 00:24:45.710
You love birds, you.
